finding math, neutral I/Q interfaces and offline sample adapters from
wa200508/airsim-rf commit f6716a6a96f9aa74618d206db16beab2f0b509a6.
Original MIT attribution is retained in licenses/airsim-rf-MIT.txt.

The project uses Apache License 2.0, matching the public AMS-GRA Hello World
